msgstr "把那东西放进嘴里简直太恶心了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1"
