msgstr "它是……活的？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
