msgstr "别人眼里，你就没换过衣服！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
