msgstr "燃烧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It's afflicted with an agrarian disease beyond my curing."
msgstr "这种耕地疾病我治不了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING"
