#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
