msgstr "这是……一块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK4"
