msgstr "这是……一块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK5"
msgid "That... is a rock."
msgstr "这是……一块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK6"
msgid "That... is a rock."
msgstr "这是……一块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK7"
msgid "That... is a rock."
msgstr "这是……一块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "The trees have eyes!!"
msgstr "这些树有眼睛！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "Back off, you lumbering lumber!"
msgstr "退后，你个笨重的大家伙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "Not to my lichen. Ha!"
msgstr "我的苔藓可别遭殃，哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "I've never taken a sick day in my life."
msgstr "我这辈子都没请过病假。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "Not at all like the lightbulbs I'm used to."
msgstr "跟我习惯的灯泡一点都不一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Neat little gizmo there."
msgstr "不错的小玩意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Electrifying! Ha!"
msgstr "带电的！哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "You and I are gonna get along."
msgstr "咱俩应该会相处得很愉快的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "It's even more interesting up close."
msgstr "凑近看感觉更有意思了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "All charged up and nowhere to go."
msgstr "已经充得满满的，无处可释放了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "That's one way to get electricity."
msgstr "这是一个获取电的办法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "Nice kilt."
msgstr "身上的褶子挺好看的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "Stop looking at me like that."
msgstr "别用那种眼神盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "Did that tree just move?"
msgstr "那棵树刚才动了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "I coulda built something with that."
msgstr "本来还可以用木头造点东西的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a hunk of wood."
msgstr "就是一大块木头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "I could use a bit of prosperity."
msgstr "我也挺想发财的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "You're alright for an axe."
msgstr "对于斧子而言，你还算不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "I don't know how it got here, but good on it."
msgstr "虽然不知道它为什么会出现在这里，不过还不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "That doesn't look right at all."
msgstr "看起来一点都不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "That is not a comforting texture!"
msgstr "这种材质让人很不舒服！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "He doesn't look none too happy."
msgstr "他看起来好像不太开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Dead as a doornail."
msgstr "已经死得透透的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "It's vegetable soup, now."
msgstr "现在已经是蔬菜汤了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "This is exactly what having a little sister's like."
msgstr "这就是有一个妹妹的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "Dead as several doornails."
msgstr "已经彻底死掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "That's a weird shrub."
msgstr "真是奇怪的灌木。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "This piece fell off. Shoddy craftsmanship."
msgstr "这一块都掉了。真是粗制滥造。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "There's nothin' on it."
msgstr "上面什么都没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "This marble's real fancy."
msgstr "这块大理石真漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "That couldn't possibly work."
msgstr "这样可不行啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "Uh, it's growing? Maybe?"
msgstr "啊，它在生长……吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "Fancy."
msgstr "真漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "That came in pretty nicely."
msgstr "还挺没有违和感的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "How does that work?"
msgstr "这是什么操作？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It's on fire."
msgstr "着火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Gnarly little bush."
msgstr "超棒的小灌木。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Gotta wait a bit."
msgstr "得稍微等一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "A tiny little plant."
msgstr "一株小小的植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Gone up in flames."
msgstr "消失在火焰中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Looks brittle."
msgstr "好像一碰就碎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "That's one down."
msgstr "已经倒下了一棵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Mhm. It's a tree."
msgstr "嗯，这是棵树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL"
msgid "Well, you're a tall piece of work."
msgstr "你还真是高啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD"
msgid "You don't scare me."
msgstr "你吓唬不了我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT"
msgid "How does that even work?"
msgstr "这玩意儿怎么用的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
msgid "Neat contraption. Can I take a look at it?"
msgstr "真是不错的装置。我能看看嘛？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
msgid "I prefer blues."
msgstr "我更喜欢蓝调音乐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "Who'd wanna to sit on THAT?"
msgstr "谁会想坐在那上面？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "Someone's eatin' good tonight!"
msgstr "有人今晚要饱餐一顿了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr "我要是没忍住的话请多包涵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT"
msgid "Well, it's dry."
msgstr "这下好，已经干了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE"
msgid "Ready for eatin'."
msgstr "可以吃了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING"
msgid "It's well on its way."
msgstr "目前的状况不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Not gonna make much progress like that."
msgstr "这样下去可不行啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
msgid "A rack for drying meat."
msgstr "一个肉架。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED"
msgid "It'll last awhile like this."
msgstr "这样的话就能保存一段时间了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM"
msgid "You sure are ugly!"
msgstr "你还真丑啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Hooboy, that's a powerful stench."
msgstr "哎哟喂，这味道可真重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd better hammer down that eyesore."
msgstr "还是一锤子砸掉这辣眼睛的东西吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "A waste of building materials."
msgstr "浪费建材。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I could disassemble that."
msgstr "我可以把这玩意儿拆掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGRATION_PORTAL.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGRATION_PORTAL.FULL"
msgid "It's packed. I'll stay put."
msgstr "已经挤得满满的了。我还是别动了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGRATION_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGRATION_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Hellooo? Anyone in there?"
msgstr "有人吗？？有人在里面吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGRATION_PORTAL.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGRATION_PORTAL.OPEN"
msgid "Make way! I'm coming through!"
msgstr "让开！我要过去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "I put that behind me."
msgstr "把阴影抛在身后。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "Swirly."
msgstr "转啊转。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Cutesy little drawing."
msgstr "可爱的小画。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "What good's a blank sign?"
msgstr "空白的指示牌有什么用？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "I hate handmade stuff."
msgstr "我讨厌手工做的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "I've had about enough of terrible beasts!"
msgstr "我已经受够各种可怕的野兽了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "Maybe there's loot inside."
msgstr "也许里面有战利品呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "That's a doozy!"
msgstr "奇怪的玩意儿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "Taking a break from the mines?"
msgstr "挖矿间歇休息一下？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "I love it."
msgstr "真是太棒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Dutiful little miner."
msgstr "尽职尽责的小矿工。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "A real strange contraption."
msgstr "真是奇怪的玩意儿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "The excavation crew's down there."
msgstr "挖掘队在下面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "No monkeying around on the job."
msgstr "工作的时候别瞎闹啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "Ha! Smells like me after a full shift!"
msgstr "哈！跟我刚下班是一个味儿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "Not sure meat's supposed to be that color."
msgstr "肉应该不是这个颜色。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "Hooboy! Is that even meat?"
msgstr "哎哟喂！这难道是肉？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Drying didn't help none."
msgstr "风干了也没什么用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "In need of a good fixin'!"
msgstr "需要好好修修！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't think it's done yet."
msgstr "这应该还没建完吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "Moonlight's good for the complexion, hey?"
msgstr "月光对皮肤有好处，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Job well done! Now what?"
msgstr "干得不错！但现在呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "Hm. This wasn't assembled right."
msgstr "唔，安装错了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "It was impractical to build this here."
msgstr "把这个建在这儿不是很合理。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Must be broke. I can still see the moon."
msgstr "一定是坏了。还能看见月亮呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "Full as can be."
msgstr "已经全满了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "Brand spanking new moon."
msgstr "非常美丽的新月。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "It's waning."
msgstr "正在月亏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "It's waxing."
msgstr "正在渐满。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "A rock with a hole in it."
msgstr "上面有个洞的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "Woah! What an odd texture."
msgstr "哇！这材质真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "That's... strange."
msgstr "好……奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "Oh, mama!"
msgstr "啊，妈妈呀！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "Animals don't build things well."
msgstr "动物都不怎么会建东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "That's where the mom keeps her babies."
msgstr "妈妈就是在这里养育她的宝宝的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "Once you've dealt with bedbugs, mosquitoes aren't so bad."
msgstr "跟臭虫战斗过后，蚊子那都不算事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "Stop wriggling, it's gross."
msgstr "别扭了，恶心死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "Ha. That's real gross."
msgstr "哈，真是好恶心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "Don'tcha just wanna noogie it?"
msgstr "你就不想搓一搓吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "Just a hole now."
msgstr "现在就是个洞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "Anything good in there, ya think?"
msgstr "你觉得里面会有好东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "That was a one-way ticket."
msgstr "进去可能就出不来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "That's really not my forte."
msgstr "这着实不是我擅长的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "Fire in the hole!"
msgstr "小心手雷！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "当真？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "All burned up."
msgstr "都被烧了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "Nothing yet."
msgstr "还没长出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "Looks like a pretty good yield."
msgstr "看来是个大丰收。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "Not much use with a dead log."
msgstr "这块烂木头已经没用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "It's real cold out."
msgstr "真是冻死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "We've got our first mushrooms!"
msgstr "第一颗蘑菇长出来了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "Lookit all that fungus."
msgstr "好多蘑菇啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Roasted."
msgstr "熟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "Where's the plug?"
msgstr "插头在哪？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "How's it work without circuitry?"
msgstr "这玩意不靠电路怎么运作的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "Roasted."
msgstr "熟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "Is there an \"on\" switch?"
msgstr "有开关吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "It lights up, even without filament."
msgstr "没有灯丝也能亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "Stink."
msgstr "好臭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a big mushroom!"
msgstr "好大的蘑菇啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Not a fan of the smell."
msgstr "我不喜欢这味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess they grow better down here?"
msgstr "在这下面大概长得更好？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Whew. That's an odor."
msgstr "呼。这味道真重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's huge!"
msgstr "好大！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED"
msgid "There's spiders in the crawlspace."
msgstr "空隙里有蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "Creepy to the core."
msgstr "令人毛骨悚然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "I don't trust that stuff."
msgstr "我不信任那玩意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "I regret poking my nose so far down here."
msgstr "我后悔在这底下挖鼻孔了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "Nothing out of place here."
msgstr "没什么奇怪的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "I'm feeling much better."
msgstr "我感觉好多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "Things seem pretty normal."
msgstr "一切看起来很正常。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "It can't possibly get worse."
msgstr "简直糟透了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "My head's starting to clear a bit."
msgstr "我的头脑开始有点清醒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "I feel uneasy for some reason."
msgstr "不知怎的我感觉有点晕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "The air's all prickly."
msgstr "空气真刺鼻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "Electricity at my fingertips."
msgstr "电流流过我的指尖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "Not too keen on touching that."
msgstr "我可不想摸那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "I got some plans in mind for that."
msgstr "我知道该怎么利用这玩意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY"
msgid "There used to be water there."
msgstr "这里以前有水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC"
msgid "Never seen such a clear lake before."
msgstr "我从未见过如此清澈的湖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "I ain't musically inclined."
msgstr "我不怎么懂音乐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "Pretty! Pretty useless."
msgstr "挺漂亮！也挺无用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Did it just get chillier?"
msgstr "它是不是刚刚变冷了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "For those with a lackluster work ethic."
msgstr "适合那些工作懒散的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "I don't like it."
msgstr "我不喜欢它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "You lookin' at me?"
msgstr "你瞅啥？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "For people who fear good, honest work."
msgstr "适合那些不愿老实干活的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "Best not open that."
msgstr "最好别打开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "Let's see if I can't play a little ditty."
msgstr "看看我能不能奏上一曲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "I don't have much use for that, personally."
msgstr "对我个人来说，这玩意没什么用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "That acid stuff burns!"
msgstr "这酸液真灼人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "I don't mix well with the upper class."
msgstr "我跟上流社会合不来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "The light's on but no one's home."
msgstr "灯开着但是家里没人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's a big fan made of tailfeathers."
msgstr "用尾羽做的大扇子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Smells like burnt gobbler."
msgstr "闻起来像是烧焦的火鸡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "We oughta put a bush in there."
msgstr "我们该放个灌木丛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I feel luckier already."
msgstr "我感觉运气爆棚了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "You work up a mighty appetite at the factory."
msgstr "在工厂干活让你胃口大开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Don't see a whole lotta use for these."
msgstr "这些玩意没多大用处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "They seem mean-spirited."
msgstr "它们似乎很卑鄙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "Solid stone."
msgstr "坚如磐石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "Please. I hock bigger loogies in my sleep."
msgstr "拜托。我梦里吐的痰都比这大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "Not my preferred kind of manual labor."
msgstr "我不喜欢这种体力活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "You don't look so tough."
msgstr "你看起来没多狠嘛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "Makes everything smell like pig."
msgstr "让一切闻起来都有股猪味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of materials."
msgstr "真是浪费材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I should hammer down that eyesore."
msgstr "我该锤扁这碍眼的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "That's a shame."
msgstr "可惜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "Fuller than a downtown tenement house."
msgstr "比闹市区的出租屋还挤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "No way that's up to code."
msgstr "这不可能符合建筑标准。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "Hey! I just want some light!"
msgstr "嗨！我只想借个光！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "Those hooves've never seen a day of work."
msgstr "这些蹄子从未干过活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "That threw a wrench into his plans."
msgstr "这就搞砸他的计划了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Chummy fellow!"
msgstr "亲密无间！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey there, ya lug!"
msgstr "你好啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "Don't want no trouble."
msgstr "我不想惹麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "I have no idea what's going on!"
msgstr "这到底是怎么回事！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "The backside of an oinker."
msgstr "猪猪的背侧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "Kitschy."
msgstr "庸俗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "That's a pine cone."
msgstr "一颗松果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "It can handle itself from here."
msgstr "剩下事情的就“顺其自然”了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "It's so... rural."
msgstr "真是很有……乡村风味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "This is beyond confusing."
msgstr "这已经不只是令人困惑的问题了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "It cooked up pretty good."
msgstr "煮得挺好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a plant."
msgstr "这是一株植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "It's hard at work."
msgstr "它正在努力生长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "Good to go."
msgstr "可以收割了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's a bit hot out."
msgstr "它有点热过头了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Hands to yourself, bucko!"
msgstr "别动手动脚的，老兄！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You better not have singed any of my projects, %s."
msgstr "你最好别参与我的工程，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey, %s! How ya doin'?"
msgstr "嗨，%s！过得好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "Stop whinin', %s, it's just a scratch!"
msgstr "别哭哭啼啼的了，%s，只是点皮肉伤！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! Get'em!"
msgstr "害人精！上啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "You're good people, %s."
msgstr "你是个好人，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Eat that and you're stuck here forever!"
msgstr "吃了那个，你就永远被困在这里了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "It does look pretty tempting."
msgstr "看起来确实很诱人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Some pomegranate seeds."
msgstr "一些石榴种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "I can't see the bottom."
msgstr "深不见底。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "Ha! Gross."
msgstr "哈！恶心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Nothing to be ashamed of."
msgstr "没什么好害臊的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "That's my kind of decor. Simple."
msgstr "我喜欢这种简洁的装饰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "Gotta eat what you can around here."
msgstr "这年头有什么吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "Hey there, pumpkin."
msgstr "你好啊，小南瓜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "Gotta indulge sometimes, hey?"
msgstr "偶尔也得放纵自己，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Not bad! Kind of sweet."
msgstr "不赖嘛！有点甜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "It's childish, but in a nice way."
msgstr "很幼稚，但是挺可爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Some pumpkin seeds."
msgstr "一些南瓜种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "It's, uh, a purple necklace."
msgstr "是个，呃，紫色项链。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "A little snooty gem."
msgstr "一颗傲慢的小宝石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "That's amore."
msgstr "这就是爱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Running after it would be pointless."
msgstr "根本跑不过它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD"
msgid "It's skittish."
msgstr "很容易受惊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Lots of excavation work around here."
msgstr "挖这个可得费不少功夫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING"
msgid "Guess it wasn't structurally sound."
msgstr "大概结构上不怎么结实。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Welp."
msgstr "哎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "How'd they build these with no thumbs?"
msgstr "它们没手指怎么造得出这个？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT"
msgid "Very practical."
msgstr "很实用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT"
msgid "Dry as a daisy. That's the phrase, right?"
msgstr "干如沙漠。是这么说的吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Must fire take everything I love?"
msgstr "为什么我喜欢的一切都会被烧焦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a mighty fine gadget."
msgstr "真是个精致的小玩意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
msgid "Lots of fresh veggies."
msgstr "许多新鲜蔬菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAZOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAZOR"
msgid "Never hurts to have more tools."
msgstr "工具多多益善。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDGEM"
msgid "Glitter doesn't really appeal to me."
msgstr "我不怎么喜欢闪闪发光的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN"
msgid "Nothing luckier around here than a light."
msgstr "没有什么比一盏灯更能带来好运了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
msgid "You get sawdust in your eye?"
msgstr "你眼里进锯末了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH"
msgid "Seems my fortune's changin'."
msgstr "看来我的运气转变了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP"
msgid "Let Max try it first."
msgstr "先让麦斯吃吃看吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Not too interested in trying that."
msgstr "我不怎么想吃那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's some sorta red mushroom."
msgstr "某种红色蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "Lazy mushroom."
msgstr "懒惰的蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Picked clean. Gotta wait."
msgstr "被摘光了。得等等。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "呃……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like they're hollow inside."
msgstr "看来里面是空心的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED"
msgid "It's on break."
msgstr "它休息了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "Workplace safety is a top priority."
msgstr "施工现场安全第一。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RELIC.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RELIC.BROKEN"
msgid "Broken and waiting for a handywoman to come along."
msgstr "坏了，正等着修理工来呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RELIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RELIC.GENERIC"
msgid "Hand craftsmanship is old hat. Mass production is the future."
msgstr "手工制作已经过时了。批量生产才是未来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
msgid "Can I make the next one?"
msgstr "我能造下一个吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC"
msgid "Rickety, but I can use it to build things."
msgstr "摇摇晃晃的，但我能用它来做东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT"
msgid "Now we get to make another!"
msgstr "现在可以再造一个了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess proximity activates the whirlygigs?"
msgstr "我猜那个转来转去的玩意走近了就会动？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT"
msgid "Let's make another."
msgstr "再造一个吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC"
msgid "Not sure how it works, but I'm gonna find out."
msgstr "不知道是什么原理，但我会弄清楚的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "The next one we make'll be better."
msgstr "下一次会造得更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "Why do we even have that lever?!"
msgstr "那个拉杆到底是干嘛用的？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "That ain't coming back to life."
msgstr "那玩意不可能复活了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks just like that egghead! Ha!"
msgstr "跟那个书呆子一模一样！哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "Does anyone actually stay dead around here?"
msgstr "这里有谁会真的死去吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "I got heart to spare."
msgstr "我有多余的心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "She ain't bothering no one."
msgstr "她没有打扰到谁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "She feels real fragile in my hands."
msgstr "她在我手心里似乎很脆弱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "She ain't bothering no one."
msgstr "她没有打扰到谁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "You're just feather and bone."
msgstr "瘦得只剩羽毛包骨了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "They don't look none too happy."
msgstr "看起来似乎不太开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "Mhm, yep. That's a rock."
msgstr "唔，没错。是块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "A bunch of rocks."
msgstr "一堆石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCKY"
msgid "Easy there, slugger!"
msgstr "悠着点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "A weirdly isolated glacier."
msgstr "一片奇怪地孤立着的冰川。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "Yep. That's a puddle."
msgstr "嗯。一个小水塘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "Yep. That's a puddle."
msgstr "嗯。一个小水塘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "Some sorta crusty rock."
msgstr "某种坚硬的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "It's losing heat."
msgstr "它正在散发热量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "A real scorcher!"
msgstr "炙手可热！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "That ain't burning no one."
msgstr "那玩意谁也烧不了了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "Seems like just another rock to me."
msgstr "看起来只是块普通的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "Solid stone."
msgstr "坚如磐石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "Solid stone."
msgstr "坚如磐石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "No way that was made in a factory."
msgstr "那玩意不可能是工厂里生产的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Get a load of this spalder."
msgstr "看这石雕啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "An essential building material."
msgstr "必不可少的建筑材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG"
msgid "Yeesh, get a whiff of that. No wait, don't!"
msgstr "天啊，你看那有多恶心。不，等等，别看！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "A big bee boogie."
msgstr "一大坨蜜蜂的痰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "The foundation's crumbling."
msgstr "地基快要崩塌了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "Transforms the wearer into the \"King of Snoot\"."
msgstr "把穿戴者变成“鬼脸之王”。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "This thulecite stuff is incredible!"
msgstr "这个叫铥矿的玩意真是太赞了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "In dire need of repairs. Good thing I'm here."
msgstr "急需修理。幸好有我在。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "Takes a saddle off real quick."
msgstr "飞快地拆掉鞍具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "How'd I get saddled with this? Ha!"
msgstr "我该怎么负担起这个？哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "Still wouldn't keep up with a Leapin' Lena..."
msgstr "还是追不上飞毛腿莱娜……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "Alright, who wants to fight?"
msgstr "好吧，谁想打架？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "Keeps livestock nice and docile."
msgstr "让家畜们温顺驯服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Things are getting gritty!"
msgstr "非常沙滑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Hit and a miss!"
msgstr "一个中了一个没中！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I can't begin to imagine how it works."
msgstr "我都想象不到这是怎么用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "What on earth is that thing?"
msgstr "这到底是什么玩意儿？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "Lit up brighter than a New York powergrid."
msgstr "比纽约的电网还要明亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "That thing does not look good."
msgstr "那玩意看起来不太舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
