#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_lavaarena
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_lavaarena"
msgid ""
"Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n"
"\n"
"The Forge is a harsh dimension of molten lava where only the toughest survive. When the survivors activated the Ancient Gateway, they mistakenly reconnected this dimension to their own."
msgstr ""
"装备这个物品来改变你的角色背景图\n"
"\n"
"熔炉是覆盖着大面积炽热熔岩的地方，只有最坚强的人才能存活下来。当幸存者激活古代传送门的时候，他们不小心把自己连接到了这个世界。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_lonecarrot
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_lonecarrot"
msgid ""
"This background portrait depicts a single carrot.\n"
"\n"
"Just one."
msgstr ""
"此背景肖像画着一根胡萝卜。\n"
"\n"
"就一根。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_lumpyevergreen
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_lumpyevergreen"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait."
msgstr "装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_marshhouse
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_marshhouse"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait."
msgstr "装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_penguins
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_penguins"
msgid ""
"Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n"
"\n"
"Pengulls live almost year-round at sea, only returning to the shore during winter to nest."
msgstr ""
"装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。\n"
"\n"
"海鸥企鹅几乎终年住在海里，只有在冬天的时候才会短暂上岸过冬。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pighouse
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pighouse"
msgid ""
"Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n"
"\n"
"Pigmen can be deceptively handy, under the right circumstances."
msgstr ""
"装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。\n"
"\n"
"在某些情况下，猪人会给人一种非常好用的错觉。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_rocks
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_rocks"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait."
msgstr "装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_roseportal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_roseportal"
msgid ""
"Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n"
"\n"
"Wilson and Maxwell constructed the first prototype of the Florid Postern, connecting the survivors' dimensions and allowing them to band together."
msgstr ""
"装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。\n"
"\n"
"威尔逊和麦斯威尔建造了初代的新生之门，从而连接起幸存者的世界，并让他们能够聚集在一起。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_shoreline
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_shoreline"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait."
msgstr "装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_spidermarsh
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_spidermarsh"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait."
msgstr "装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_spikymarsh
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_spikymarsh"
msgid ""
"Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n"
"\n"
"Spiders are vicious creatures that can survive nearly any climate."
msgstr ""
"装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。\n"
"\n"
"蜘蛛是残酷的生物，几乎能在任何气候下生存。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_thickforest
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_thickforest"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait."
msgstr "装备此物品以更改角色的背景肖像。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_abigail_flower
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_abigail_flower"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to Abigail's flower.\n"
"\n"
"Abigail's flower is Wendy's only remaining keepsake of her departed sister."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为阿比盖尔的花。\n"
"\n"
"阿比盖尔的花是温蒂仅有的可以用来纪念亡姊的物品。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_babybeefalo
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_babybeefalo"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a baby beefalo."
msgstr "将你的头像改为野牛宝宝。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bat_furled
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bat_furled"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a furled up batilisk."
msgstr "将你的头像改为收拢的洞穴蝙蝠。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bearger_roar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bearger_roar"
msgid "Set your profile icon to an angry bearger."
msgstr "将你的头像改为愤怒的熊獾。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_beefalo
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_beefalo"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a big beefalo."
msgstr "将你的头像改为大野牛。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bernie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bernie"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to Bernie the Bear.\n"
"\n"
"Bernie's never abandoned Willow, and she plans to always return the favor."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为伯尼熊。\n"
"\n"
"伯尼永远不会抛弃薇洛，反过来也一样。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bishop
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_bishop"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a clockwork bishop.\n"
"\n"
"Maxwell produced many Clockwork Bishops during his reign on the Shadow Throne."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为发条主教。\n"
"\n"
"麦斯威尔在暗影王座统治期间，制造了许多发条主教。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_catcoon
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_catcoon"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a cute catcoon."
msgstr "将你的头像改为可爱卡通。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_chester
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_chester"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a Chester.\n"
"\n"
"Chester is survivor's best friend."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为切斯特。\n"
"\n"
"切斯特是幸存者最好的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_crow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_crow"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a crow."
msgstr "将你的头像改为乌鸦。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_cupcake
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_cupcake"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a tasty cupcake."
msgstr "将你的头像改为美味的小蛋糕。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_deerclops
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_deerclops"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a furious Deerclops."
msgstr "将你的头像改为暴怒的鹿角怪。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_dragonfly_sleeping
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_dragonfly_sleeping"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a sleepy Dragonfly."
msgstr "将你的头像改为瞌睡的蜻蜓龙。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_dragonfruit
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_dragonfruit"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a tasty dragon fruit."
msgstr "将你的头像改为好吃的火龙果。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_frog
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_frog"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a frog."
msgstr "将你的头像改为青蛙。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_goosemoose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_goosemoose"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a Goose. Or Moose. Or both."
msgstr "将你的头像改为一只鹅，或者驼鹿。或者两者都是。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_hound
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_hound"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a hound."
msgstr "将你的头像改为猎犬。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_knight
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_knight"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a clockwork knight.\n"
"\n"
"Maxwell produced many Clockwork Knights during his reign on the Shadow Throne."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为发条骑士。\n"
"\n"
"麦斯威尔在暗影王座统治期间，制造了许多发条骑士。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_koalefant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_koalefant"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a skittish koalefant."
msgstr "将你的头像改为浮躁的无尾象。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_krampus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_krampus"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to Krampus.\n"
"\n"
"The Krampus is compelled to visit all naughty denizens of The Constant."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为坎普斯。\n"
"\n"
"坎普斯会去找永恒领域里不听话的小朋友。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_mactusk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_mactusk"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a MacTusk."
msgstr "将你的头像改为海象爸爸。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_mandrake
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_mandrake"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to squeaky mandrake.\n"
"\n"
"\"MEEP!\""
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为吱吱作响的曼德拉草。\n"
"\n"
"“哔哔！”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_merm
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_merm"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a merm."
msgstr "将你的头像改为鱼人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_mole
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_mole"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a moleworm."
msgstr "将你的头像改为鼹鼠。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_nightlight
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_nightlight"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a burning Night Light."
msgstr "将你的头像改为烧着的夜灯。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pengull
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pengull"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a pengull."
msgstr "将你的头像改为海鸥企鹅。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_phonograph
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_phonograph"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a nightmarish gramophone.\n"
"\n"
"It only plays one song."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为梦魇留声机。\n"
"\n"
"它只能播放一首歌。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pig_happy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pig_happy"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a pigman.\n"
"\n"
"Most pigmen are amicable to the idea of teaming up, once they've been shown a bit of kindness."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为猪人。\n"
"\n"
"只要对他们友善一点，大多数猪人都很乐意组队。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pigking
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pigking"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to the Pig King.\n"
"\n"
"The Pig King has vast riches and can be persuaded to share them, should someone find something to pique his interest."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为猪猪国王。\n"
"\n"
"猪猪国王拥有着享之不尽的财富，只要能找到可以引起他兴趣的东西，他就愿意分享这些财富。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pumpkinlantern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_pumpkinlantern"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a pumpkin lantern."
msgstr "将你的头像改为南瓜灯。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_rabbit
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_rabbit"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a rabbit."
msgstr "将你的头像改为兔子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_rook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_rook"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a clockwork rook.\n"
"\n"
"Maxwell produced many Clockwork Rooks during his reign on the Shadow Throne."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为发条战车。\n"
"\n"
"麦斯威尔在暗影王座统治期间，制造了许多发条战车。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_rose"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a rose flower.\n"
"\n"
"Few things are as timeless as a red rose."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为玫瑰花。\n"
"\n"
"很少有东西像红玫瑰一样经久不衰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_shadowhand
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_shadowhand"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a creepy night hand."
msgstr "将你的头像改为一只可怕的手。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_shadowmanipulator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_shadowmanipulator"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a Shadow Manipulator."
msgstr "将你的头像改为暗影操控器。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_smallbird
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_smallbird"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a tiny smallbird."
msgstr "将你的头像改为小高脚雏鸟。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_spider
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_spider"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a spider."
msgstr "将你的头像改为蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_tallbird_eye
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_tallbird_eye"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a glaring tallbird."
msgstr "将你的头像改为愤怒的高脚鸟。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_treeguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_treeguard"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a treeguard.\n"
"\n"
"These lumbering spirits will rise to defend their ilk when the forest is threatened."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为树精。\n"
"\n"
"这些行动迟缓的精灵会在森林受到威胁时保护他们的同伴。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_trinket_faketeeth
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_trinket_faketeeth"
msgid "Set your profile icon to second-hand dentures."
msgstr "将你的头像改为二手假牙。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_trinket_gnome
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_trinket_gnome"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a gnome."
msgstr "将你的头像改为地精。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_trinket_gnomette
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_trinket_gnomette"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a gnome."
msgstr "将你的头像改为地精。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_waffle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_waffle"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to some tasty waffles.\n"
"\n"
"Part of a balanced breakfast."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为美味的华夫饼。\n"
"\n"
"均衡早餐必不可少"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_werepig_howl
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_werepig_howl"
msgid "Set your profile icon to a howling werepig."
msgstr "将你的头像改为嚎叫的狂猪。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_wererabbit
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.profileflair_wererabbit"
msgid ""
"Set your profile icon to a grinning bunnyman.\n"
"\n"
"Bunnymen make their homes deep in the caverns of The Constant."
msgstr ""
"将你的头像改为微笑的兔人。\n"
"\n"
"兔人把家安在永恒领域地下深处的洞穴里。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.puppy_winter
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.puppy_winter"
msgid "Looks like this adorable little lump grew his winter coat in. Good boy, Vargling!"
msgstr "看来这个可爱的小家伙身上长出了他自己的冬大衣呢。乖乖，瓦格灵！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.puppy_winter_builder
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.puppy_winter_builder"
msgid "missing description"
msgstr "缺乏描述"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.rainhat_floppy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.rainhat_floppy"
msgid "rainhat_floppy"
msgstr "rainhat_floppy"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_pod
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_pod"
msgid "This pod uses space-age printing technology to perform unspace-age alchemy. How stylish!"
msgstr "这个用来炼金的平台是使用太空时代的3D打印科技制造的。洋气十足！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_pod_alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_pod_alt"
msgid "This pod uses space-age printing technology to perform unspace-age alchemy. How stylish!"
msgstr "这个用来炼金的平台是使用太空时代的3D打印科技制造的。洋气十足！"

