msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab4_glommer_costume"
msgid "researchlab4_glommer_costume"
msgstr "researchlab4_glommer_costume"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab4_hutch_costume
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab4_hutch_costume"
msgid "researchlab4_hutch_costume"
msgstr "researchlab4_hutch_costume"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid"
msgid "The slings and arrows of fate have taken their toll on this poor, afflicted heart."
msgstr "命运的弓矢已经狠狠射进了这颗饱受困扰的可怜小心脏里。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_rose"
msgid "No sharper than any other spear, though much lovelier."
msgstr "跟其他的矛一样锋利，但是颜值要高多了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.strawhat_floppy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.strawhat_floppy"
msgid "Be like a little British lady in your garden!"
msgstr ""
"在你的花园里要举止像个英国\n"
"小姑娘！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_derby
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_derby"
msgid "Demonstrate your impeccable style with this dapper bowler hat."
msgstr ""
"戴着这顶利落的圆顶礼帽展示\n"
"你完美的风度吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_festive_bell_red_firehound
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_festive_bell_red_firehound"
msgid "A festive 'firehound red' colored tophat."
msgstr "节日“地狱犬红”的大礼帽。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_pillar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_pillar"
msgid "Doesn't burn any brighter or last any longer, but goodness-gosh if it isn't just the fanciest."
msgstr "燃烧持续的时间不太长，也不是很明亮，不过就算不是最漂亮的，也同样非常令人惊叹。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_rag
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_rag"
msgid "Give your torch some visual flare with these hastily wrapped, desiccated rags. Smoky!"
msgstr ""
"给你的火把添加\n"
"一些碎布来燃烧，\n"
"让它更具独特风\n"
"格。呛人吧！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_shadow_alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_shadow_alt"
msgid "At first glance this torch appears menacing, but holding it makes you feel quite sad."
msgstr "乍看之下，这个火把很吓人，但是握在手中却让人感觉淡淡的忧伤。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_spooky
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_spooky"
msgid "Repel the dark these Hallowed Nights with a dreadful beacon of most Hallowed Light."
msgstr ""
"在这神圣的夜里用最神圣的灯\n"
"光驱散黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_carpetbag
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_carpetbag"
msgid "This bag made from luxurious carpet is the height of modern fashion!"
msgstr "这个用奢华毡毯做的包简直代表了时尚的顶峰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_gingerbread
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_gingerbread"
msgid "Don't be fooled... it's completely inedible."
msgstr "别被忽悠了……这是不能吃的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_posh
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_posh"
msgid "A chest worthy of storing your finest gems and treasures. Or, y'know, twigs and manure."
msgstr "配得上最高价的宝石和宝物的宝箱。看实际情况，也可以用来装树枝和废料啦。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_poshprint
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_poshprint"
msgid "No Chesters were harmed in the making of this chest... I think."
msgstr ""
"做这个箱子应该不会有切斯特\n"
"受到伤害……吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_sacred
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_sacred"
msgid "The history of an ancient people is locked away inside."
msgstr "古代人民的一段历史被尘封在其中。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_steamertrunk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_steamertrunk"
msgid "NOTE: Doesn't steam."
msgstr "注意：不要拿去蒸。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traincase
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traincase"
msgid "Organize your foraged scraps in class and style."
msgstr "把杂乱无章的行李整理得整洁高档又时髦。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traveltrunk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traveltrunk"
msgid "Its traveling days may be over, but it'll always have the memories."
msgstr "它四处旅行的日子也许已经结束了，不过其中的回忆会永远留在心中。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_combatant"
msgid "Wigfrid was born for the arena."
msgstr "薇格弗德是为竞技场而生的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops"
msgid ""
"Deerfrid Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"暗黑鹿服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_d"
msgid "Wigfrid chose to be one of her favorite foes to battle for Hallowed Nights."
msgstr "薇格弗德选择在万圣节装扮成自己最喜欢的对手。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_gladiator"
msgid "The question was never IF Wigfrid would master the ring, but when."
msgstr "薇格弗德能否统治擂台从来不是问题，问题只是什么时候。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rose"
msgid "Wigfrid was born for the part of Red Queen."
msgstr "维格弗里德就是为红皇后而生的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadow"
msgid "Go to the dark side and be on top of the world."
msgstr ""
"坠入黑暗，站在\n"
"世界的巅峰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivor"
msgid "A warrior cannot eat until she defeats some meat."
msgstr ""
"不击败敌人，\n"
"哪有肉吃。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_combatant"
msgid "Maxwell believes this look to be quite intimidating."
msgstr "麦斯威尔相信这幅样子很吓人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formal"
msgid "Against all possible odds Maxwell has become even more dapper."
msgstr ""
"麦斯威尔出乎意料\n"
"的变得更加衣冠\n"
"楚楚了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_gladiator"
msgid "Maxwell is both dark AND brooding."
msgstr "麦斯威尔阴暗且凶险。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus"
msgid ""
"Krampwell Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"坎普斯服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_d"
msgid "Maxwell deeply regrets asking the others to choose his costume for him."
msgstr "麦斯威尔很后悔让其他人帮自己选装扮。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rose"
msgid "Ladies and gentlemen, a round of applause for our lovely assistant."
msgstr "女士们，先生们，掌声有请我们可爱的助手。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivor"
msgid "This is Maxwell, the intrepid explorer."
msgstr ""
"这位是强悍的\n"
"探索者麦斯威尔。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadow"
msgid "Before it all went so wrong..."
msgstr ""
"之前一切还很\n"
"顺利的……"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat"
msgid ""
"Webilisk Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"蛛丝服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_d"
msgid "Gosh, those wings look very... real."
msgstr "天哪，这翅膀看起来也太......逼真了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_combatant"
msgid "Webber's used to fending for himself."
msgstr "韦伯已经习惯了为自己而战。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_gladiator"
msgid "It's not wise to corner venomous spiders."
msgstr "把毒蜘蛛逼入绝境是不明智的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rose"
msgid "The rosebuds are tangled in there real good."
msgstr "玫瑰花蕾很好地纠缠在其中。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadow"
msgid "Dark spiders have poisonous fangs."
msgstr "暗色蜘蛛一般长有毒牙。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivor"
msgid "Webber looks a little worse for the wear."
msgstr ""
"韦伯穿上后更加\n"
"惨不忍睹了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_combatant"
msgid "If Wendy is to succumb to death, she'll do so on her own terms."
msgstr "就算温蒂要屈服于死亡，她也要按自己的风格去做。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_gladiator"
msgid "Wendy's hidden ruthlessness needed only slight provocation to show itself."
msgstr "只需一点刺激，温蒂体内隐藏的残酷血液就会迸发。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant"
msgid ""
"Wendyflower Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"温蒂花瓣服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_d"
msgid "Wendy quite fancies this hair color."
msgstr "温蒂很喜欢这个发色。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rose"
msgid "A dark crimson rose represents mourning."
msgstr "深红色的玫瑰寄托着哀思。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadow"
msgid "Wendy has always been comfortable with darkness."
msgstr "温迪习惯了黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivor"
msgid "Wendy is actually pretty good at surviving."
msgstr ""
"温蒂的野外生存技\n"
"巧真的很不赖。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_combatant"
msgid "Wes is quiet, but not meek."
msgstr "韦斯很安静，但不怯懦。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_gladiator"
msgid "Beware the battle mime."
msgstr "小心战斗哑剧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake"
msgid ""
"Wesdrake Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"韦斯德雷克服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_d"
msgid "What's the sound of one mandrake meeping?"
msgstr "曼德拉草的叫声是什么样的？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rose"
msgid "Wes always felt his rosy cheeks were his best feature."
msgstr "韦斯一直觉得粉红的脸颊是他身上最美的部位。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadow"
msgid "The sun is too bright. It blots out the darkness."
msgstr ""
"阳光过于灿烂，\n"
"直接抹去了黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivor"
msgid "Even mimes can fight if confronted with a monster."
msgstr ""
"走投无路时哪怕是\n"
"喜剧演员都会狗急\n"
"跳墙。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_combatant"
msgid "Wickerbottom is not opposed to self defense, should the occasion call for it."
msgstr "若情况危急，薇克巴顿不排除采取自卫的手段。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_gladiator"
msgid "Wickerbottom adapted to life in the arena with grace and ease."
msgstr "薇克巴顿能够轻松优雅地适应竞技场的生活。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat"
msgid ""
"Ms. Voltbottom Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"闪电伯顿小姐服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_d"
msgid "An elegant costume for an elegant woman."
msgstr "优雅女士的优雅装扮。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rose"
msgid "Now duel for the rose queen's amusement."
msgstr "为取悦玫瑰皇后而决斗吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadow"
msgid "A librarian knows how to watch from the shadows."
msgstr ""
"图书管理员都\n"
"懂得利用暗影的\n"
"掩护来观察。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivor"
msgid "Those with knowledge are good at making do in difficult circumstances."
msgstr ""
"学富五车的人能够\n"
"在困局中脱颖而出。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_combatant"
msgid "Willow was never one to be pushed around."
msgstr "薇洛永远不会任人摆布。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly"
msgid ""
"Willowfly Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"薇洛蜻蜓服装\n"
"\n"
"仅在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_d"
msgid "Willow would dress like this every day if she could."
msgstr "薇洛恨不得每天都穿成这样。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_gladiator"
msgid "Willow will reduce this ring to cinders."
msgstr "薇洛会把此擂台化为灰烬。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rose"
msgid "Willow was always a bit prickly. Now she's just moreso."
msgstr "薇洛向来有些敏感，现在她更是如此。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadow"
msgid "Willow enjoys flickering flames of inky blackness."
msgstr ""
"薇洛喜欢乌黑的\n"
"火花闪烁。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivor"
msgid "Willow is taming the wilderness with fire."
msgstr ""
"薇洛正在用火征服\n"
"大自然。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_combatant"
msgid "This wouldn't be the first time Wilson's had to fight off a goon or two."
msgstr "这已经不是威尔逊第一次被迫和一两个傻瓜战斗了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_gladiator"
msgid "Wilson is willing to take on any challenger."
msgstr "威尔逊愿意迎接任何人的挑战。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard"
msgid ""
"Piggsbury Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"猪人莓服装\n"
"\n"
"仅在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_d"
msgid "Wilson usually forgets to put a costume together until the last moment. He's always busy experimenting."
msgstr "威尔逊总是到最后一刻才想起穿上装扮。他总是忙着做实验。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rose"
msgid "Who knew rose dye was so permanent?"
msgstr "谁知道玫瑰染料不掉色呢？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadow"
msgid "Wilson has learned the science of shadows."
msgstr ""
"威尔森掌握了暗影\n"
"的科学知识。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivor"
msgid "As a scientist, Wilson is well equipped to investigate the natural world."
msgstr ""
"身为一位科学家，\n"
"威尔森拥有充分的\n"
"准备去探险大自然。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_combatant"
msgid "Winona came ready for a fight!"
msgstr "威诺娜是有备而来的！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formal"
msgid "This isn't what Winona expected when she read \"Formal Assembly\" on the invitation."
msgstr "威诺娜误解了邀请函上“正式集会”的含义。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_gladiator"
msgid "Winona's tough as nails and ready to throw down."
msgstr "威诺娜坚韧如铁，已经准备好接受锤炼了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko"
msgid ""
"Nona Gekko Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"诺娜壁虎装扮\n"
"\n"
"限时穿戴。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko_d"
msgid "It wasn't easy for Winona to get her hair like that."
msgstr "要威诺娜把头发弄成这样可不是件容易的事。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_rose"
msgid "By any other name, she'd smell of engine grease."
msgstr "要是取了任何其它的名字，她闻起来就像机油了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_shadow"
msgid "No one knows the depths of Winona's dark machinations."
msgstr "没有人知道威诺娜的城府到底有多深。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_survivor"
msgid "Winona's always been made of rough stuff."
msgstr "威诺娜一直都很坚强。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_black_davys
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_black_davys"
msgid "A dark winter hat for the dark winter months."
msgstr "黑暗冬月配套的黑暗冬帽。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_pink_hibiscus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_pink_hibiscus"
msgid "Doesn't keep your head any warmer than a regular winter hat, but gosh if it isn't just the cutest."
msgstr ""
"虽然和普通冬帽没什么区别，\n"
"但天哪，这顶造型超可爱啊。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_plum_pudding
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_plum_pudding"
msgid "This plum pudding hat contains no plums. Just a bunch of raisins."
msgstr "这顶李子布丁帽不含任何李子。只有一把提子干。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_rooster
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_rooster"
msgid "This winter hat is strangely reminiscent of a small feathered friend."
msgstr "这顶冬帽莫名其妙地会让人想起一位长满羽毛的小朋友。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_stocking_cap_green_forest
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_stocking_cap_green_forest"
msgid "One might wear this 'forest guardian green' winter hat on a cozy night around a campfire. Or, hey, they might not."
msgstr "也许有人会在舒适的夜晚戴上这顶'森林守卫绿'的冬帽围坐在营火旁边。嘛，毕竟是绿帽子，也许没人会愿意戴。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_combatant"
msgid "Wolfgang's no stranger to the art of pugilism."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈对拳术驾轻就熟。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_gladiator"
msgid "This look suits Wolfgang, and he knows it."
msgstr "这幅样子很适合沃尔夫冈，他很清楚。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_rose"
msgid "This moustache doesn't tickle, it prickles."
msgstr "这撮小胡子一点都不痒痒，很扎人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_shadow"
msgid "Wolfgang is even mightier than usual."
msgstr ""
"沃尔夫冈比往常\n"
"还要健壮。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_survivor"
msgid "In the wilderness, only the mighty survive."
msgstr ""
"在野外，只有强者\n"
"才能生存。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus"
msgid ""
"MacWolf Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"麦克沃服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus_d"
msgid "It seems a shame to hide such luxurious hair."
msgstr "这么漂亮的头发遮起来就可惜了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_combatant"
msgid "It's best not to mess with a man and his axe."
msgstr "最好不要惹拿斧头的男人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_gladiator
