#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_rose"
msgid "Woodie tends his own garden more often than he tends his own hair."
msgstr "伍迪对他花园的关心胜过他的头发。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_shadow"
msgid "The shadow realm is pretty much the same as here, just darker."
msgstr ""
"暗影领域跟这里\n"
"差不多，只是更\n"
"加黑暗而已。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_survivor"
msgid "Woodie looks like he's turning into a tree."
msgstr ""
"伍迪似乎快要变成\n"
"一棵树了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard"
msgid ""
"Woodguard Costume\n"
"\n"
"Wearable for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"树林守卫服装\n"
"\n"
"在限定的时间内可穿着。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard_d"
msgid "Woodie will have twigs stuck in his beard for weeks. Not that that's unusual."
msgstr "伍迪的胡子里可能好几周都夹着树枝。这并不奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_combatant"
msgid "Few things get them more excited than the prospect of destroying fleshlings."
