#. STRINGS.UI.CREDITS.THANKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.CREDITS.THANKS"
msgid ""
"And a very special thanks to all our supporters who braved the challenge of the \"Early-Access\n"
"Beta\". You are too numerous to name - our amazing moderators, the wonderful artists, musicians,\n"
"livestreamers, to all who made a Let's Play video and everybody who chimed in to let us know\n"
"exactly what you think. Your encouragement, passion and support has been amazing.\n"
"\n"
"Don't Starve Together is truly a better game because of all of you."
msgstr ""
"特别感谢那些尝试”抢先体验Beta版本”的玩家。感谢来自来自各行各业的你们——论坛版主、画家、音乐家还有各位主播，还有那些制作游戏视频以及向我们反映了意见的所有玩家。你们对我们热情的鼓励以及支持让我们造就了这个游戏。\n"
"\n"
"是你们让饥荒如此出色。"

