#. STRINGS.UI.ENDGAME.BODY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.ENDGAME.BODY2"
msgid ""
" ever escape?\n"
" Perhaps %s, too, will tire of this wretched place, and use %s new powers to tempt the unsuspecting.\n"
"\n"
"The mysterious beings that control this realm still lurk in the shadows, and new challenges will soon be revealed.\n"
"\n"
"Until then,\n"
"- The Don't Starve Team -"
msgstr ""
"逃出来了吗？也许%s也会对这块贫瘠的土地心生厌烦，然后使用%s的能力去引诱毫无防备的人。\n"
"\n"
"这块土地神秘的统治者还隐藏在幕后，新的挑战就将来临。\n"
"\n"
"敬请期待，\n"
"- 饥荒团队 -"

